# `ds_engine_mem`'s counts over String facts ([NDBG.2.1]): `19_interp_slot`'s
# steps with a `mem` read before anything and after the last pump. The facts
# carry String slots, two built by interpolation and one an identity key. The
# intern fields are implementation-defined ([NDBG.2.1], [NMET.4.7]), so the
# logical counts are compared.
mem
assert Reading id=1 zone=kitchen level=7
pump
assert Reading id=2 zone=kitchen level=7
pump
assert Reading id=3 zone=kitchen level=9
pump
mem
